  abstract={Presents the design of a monitoring software for predictive maintenance in smart-factory systems, grounded in international reliability standards. Machine learning models are used for equipment fault prediction and condition monitoring, with the software architecture organized around reliability and maintainability requirements. Work conducted as part of a Samsung Heavy Industries project at the Embedded & Software Lab, Ajou University.}
